# Applied to static assets served directly by Workers' asset layer
# (app.css, draw.js, gallery.js, htmx.min.js, favicon.svg, og.png,
# llms.txt). Per https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
# these rules are NOT applied to responses generated by the Worker script
# (src/index.ts sets the equivalent headers there for /, /drawings, /agent,
# /hi, /drawings/:id/image, /robots.txt, /sitemap.xml).
#
# Cache-Control/ETag are left alone: Workers' default
# "public, max-age=0, must-revalidate" + ETag is already a good validator-
# backed cache for these files.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), magnetometer=(), gyroscope=(), accelerometer=(), interest-cohort=()
